 "summary": {
  "text": "The query returned 24 rows. Total amount across the returned period is 118,427. The average total amount per period is 4,934. The highest value was 6,273 at 2025-12-01, 1.27x the average. The lowest value was 3,531 at 2024-01-01. Over the period the value increased from 3,531 to 6,273, a change of 77.6%. Values vary with a standard deviation of 853.96.\n\nBecause the series carries a strong trend (R\u00b2 = 0.98), anomalies were measured as deviations from that trend rather than from a flat average, with a normal deviation range of -352.51 to 358.53. Feb 2025 is a moderate high outlier at 5,424, 9.9% from the mean.\n\nA linear regression model was selected and projects 3 month periods ahead. Total Amount for Jan 2026 is projected at 6,430, within a 95% confidence range of 6,175 to 6,685. Total Amount for Feb 2026 is projected at 6,550, within a 95% confidence range of 6,189 to 6,910. Total Amount for Mar 2026 is projected at 6,669, within a 95% confidence range of 6,228 to 7,111. Across the full 3-period horizon the projected total is 19,649. The Mar 2026 projection of 6,669 sits 35.2% above the historical average of 4,934. Forecast uncertainty widens with distance: the interval at the final period is 1.73x as wide as at the first. On the observed data the model's mean absolute percentage error is 1.8%.",
